# Rumspringa POS System (v7.0)

A complete Point of Sale (POS) system developed for convenience stores and tobacco shops, focused on real-world daily operations, financial control, and fast cashier workflow.

The project was designed with emphasis on:

* simplicity;
* operational speed;
* local/offline usage without servers;
* stability for daily use;
* modern and responsive interface.

## Main Features

### 📊 Dashboard

* Daily financial overview;
* Daily sales tracking;
* Credit account (Fiado) control;
* Cash drawer monitoring;
* Real-time recent transactions;
* Quick transaction editing.

### 🛒 Sales / POS

* Full shopping cart system;
* Fast product search;
* USB barcode scanner support;
* Fast scan mode and manual quantity mode;
* Manual/custom items;
* Discount control;
* Change calculation;
* Cash, Pix, Debit, Credit, and Credit Account sales;
* Receipt printing.

### 👥 Customers / Credit Accounts

* Customer registration;
* Debt management;
* Payment registration;
* Individual account closing;
* Purchase history;
* Printable customer statements.

### 📦 Inventory

* Product registration and editing;
* Quantity control;
* Product code management;
* Barcode scanner integration.

### 💸 Withdrawals

* Physical and digital withdrawal records;
* Separate origin tracking;
* Integrated with reports and daily closing.

### 📄 Reports

* Complete financial reports;
* A4 printable reports;
* Period filtering;
* Totals by payment method;
* Withdrawal tracking;
* Proper credit account handling;
* Digital balance summary;
* CSV and Excel export.

### 🔒 Daily Closing

* Complete daily cash closing;
* Initial cash/change tracking;
* Initial/final digital balance;
* Withdrawal control;
* Professional A4 printing;
* Closing history.

### 📜 Audit System

* Detailed operation logs;
* Sales history;
* Edit tracking;
* Deletion tracking;
* Credit account payment tracking;
* Administrative auditing.

### ⚙️ Backup and Settings

* Full JSON backup;
* Data restoration;
* Fee/tax management;
* Persistent configuration system.

